course: dictionary
lesson: 9201
title: Software: the programs inside
level: primary-6
stars: 0
explain: Every computer, phone and tablet needs instructions to do anything. Those instructions are called software. Software is the programs and apps that tell a device what to do.
explain: You cannot touch software. The parts you can touch, like the screen, the keyboard and the chips inside, are called hardware. Hardware is the box; software is the programs that run on it.
explain: Software comes in many kinds: games, web browsers, word processors and operating systems. «Install software» means putting a new program onto a device. «Update the software» means fixing and improving a program you already have.
explain: Keep your software up to date, and only download it from trusted places. «Antivirus software» helps protect a device from harmful programs. Some software is criminal, so always check where a program comes from before you open it.
fact: Software is the programs and apps that tell a computer, phone or other device what to do.
fact: Hardware is the physical parts you can touch, such as the screen and the chips.
fact: Examples of software are games, web browsers, word processors and operating systems.
fact: «Legacy system» means old, outdated software.
fact: «Undocumented feature» is a joking name for a software bug.
exercise: «Some people build the boxes and some the programs: software engineers write the code.» Which job writes the programs? | Electrician | Chef | *Software engineer | Hardware engineer
exercise: Which of these is software? | *Web browser | Screen | Keyboard | Charger
exercise: «Legacy system» means what? | A joke about bugs | A type of keyboard | *Old, outdated software | A brand-new computer
test: «Ransomware is criminal software that locks files and demands payment.» What does ransomware do? | Makes your screen bigger | Helps you save your files | *Locks your files and demands payment | Speeds up the internet
test: Which one is hardware, not software? | Operating system | *The screen | Word processor | Web browser
exam: Mia says, «Update the software on your tablet.» What does update mean here? | *Fix and improve the program you already have | Make the screen smaller | Throw the program away | Turn the tablet off forever
